!! General Section Issues

Why aren't all of the PU je PU and PU-ZEhA entries in here? I think we're missing cajepu, baze'a, anything with ze'i/ze'u, etc. Do we even really need to include PU* in this list? -lindar
* Looking at the list, I'd say that the PU* that are needed are {baba}, {bapu}, {puba}, and {pupu}, as they have special meaning not entirely related to the individual cmavo they are made of. I don't think the other entries really need a separate definition, except possibly {ca ma}, as their meanings are fairly obvious if one knows the meanins of the component cmavo, as in {baze'i}: {ba} (future) {ze'a} (short time interval) = a short time in the future.
